### Part 2: Intermediate SQL Queries (JOINs & Aggregation)

#### Query 2.1: Revenue by Category

**Purpose:** Understand profit concentration across product lines

**Query:**

```sql
SELECT p.Category, 
       SUM(s.Quantity * s.UnitPrice) AS TotalRevenue,
       SUM(s.Profit) AS TotalProfit
FROM Sales s
JOIN Products p ON s.ProductID = p.ProductID
GROUP BY p.Category
ORDER BY TotalRevenue DESC;
```

**Results:**

