|-------------------|-----------|----------|------|
|**Electronics**    |R13,597,487|R4,383,977|32.3% |
|**Home Appliances**|R3,644,085 |R1,195,540|32.8% |
|**Lifestyle Goods**|R1,025,885 |R335,571  |32.7% |

**Strategic Insight:**

- Electronics dominates revenue (~75% of total)
- Profit margins consistent across categories (32-33%)
- Electronics is the growth engine; lifestyle goods are secondary

