## Data Quality & Methodology

### Data Overview

|Table    |Records|Date Range|Quality       |
|---------|-------|----------|--------------|
|Products |30     |Static    |✅ Complete    |
|Customers|500    |2020-2023 |✅ Complete    |
|Sales    |2,500  |2023-2024 |✅ Complete    |
